stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> RUN: Left / Right keydown
    RUN --> IDLE: All direction keys released
    IDLE --> SLEEP: Idle for 5 seconds
    SLEEP --> IDLE: Space keydown
    SLEEP --> RUN: Left / Right keydown
    IDLE --> AUTORUN: A keydown
    SLEEP --> AUTORUN: A keydown (wake up)
    AUTORUN --> IDLE: 5 seconds elapsed
    AUTORUN --> RUN: Left / Right keydown (cancel)
    AUTORUN: AutoRun class / invincible
    AUTORUN: Speed 600 px per second / scale 1.5
    AUTORUN: Reflect at edges / no key needed
